{"event":"step_update","step_update":{"conversation_id":"3b1198c2-3bc4-43fe-9186-cbcd404239b5","step_index":19,"state":"DONE","step_type":"tool","tool_name":"run_command","duration_seconds":0.181663017,"tool_info":{"name":"run_command","parameters":{"CommandLine":"git show 3d39b25"},"output":"Created At: 2026-11-22T21:42:36+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-11-22T21:42:36+05:30\nCommand exited with code 0.\n\nCommand output:\ncommit 3d39b25aace335fcaad62438978f06a4a1089c35 (HEAD -\u003e remediation/main)\r\nAuthor: Snehan S \u003csnehankgs@gmail.com\u003e\r\nDate:   Sun Nov 22 21:41:29 2026 +0530\r\n\r\n    chore(tracker): advance F-009 and F-011 to FIXED-UNVERIFIED with regression test evidence\r\n\r\ndiff --git a/audit/tracker/tracker.json b/audit/tracker/tracker.json\r\nindex ae69f3f..ebb35cd 100644\r\n--- a/audit/tracker/tracker.json\r\n+++ b/audit/tracker/tracker.json\r\n@@ -121,7 +121,7 @@\r\n     ],\r\n     \"effort\": \"S\",\r\n     \"owner\": \"agent\",\r\n-    \"status\": \"REJECTED\",\r\n+    \"status\": \"FIXED-UNVERIFIED\",\r\n     \"statusHistory\": [\r\n       {\r\n         \"status\": \"OPEN\",\r\n@@ -150,11 +150,25 @@\r\n         \"commit\": \"af12729225d5acc2312118d99080a1c8a72f557f\",\r\n         \"evidenceLink\": \"audit/evidence/verify/F-009/10-expected-vs-actual.txt\",\r\n         \"note\": \"REJECTED at Step 2, Step 4, and Step 5: (1) Broken column reference in migration.sql line 81: sales_invoice_line uses \\\"invoiceId\\\" not \\\"salesInvoiceId\\\", causing PL/pgSQL runtime crash on all line UPDATE/DELETE; (2) Status downgrade bypass: enforce_sales_invoice_immutability() allows updating status from POSTED to DRAFT, enabling subsequent unconditional DELETE of posted invoices; (3) Snapshot fields (customerNameSnapshot, companyGstinSnapshot) are unconstrained on POSTED invoices; (4) Mutant 3 survived because server/src/db-immutability.test.ts contains 0 tests for sales_invoice_line.\"\r\n+      },\r\n+      {\r\n+        \"status\": \"IN-PROGRESS\",\r\n+        \"date\": \"2026-11-22\",\r\n+        \"commit\": null,\r\n+        \"evidenceLink\": \"audit/evidence/before-F-009-refix.txt\",\r\n+        \"note\": \"Re-fixing F-009 to address 4 verifier rejection points.\"\r\n+      },\r\n+      {\r\n+        \"status\": \"FIXED-UNVERIFIED\",\r\n+        \"date\": \"2026-11-22\",\r\n+        \"commit\": \"ba71207ae75581b11bd721c95c3a00cfa8730500\",\r\n+        \"evidenceLink\": \"audit/evidence/after-F-009-refix.txt\",\r\n+        \"note\": \"Fixed sales_invoice_line column name, blocked status downgrade from POSTED to DRAFT, locked snapshot fields, and expanded tests in server/src/db-immutability.test.ts.\"\r\n       }\r\n     ],\r\n     \"reproCommand\": \"npx vitest run --exclude '**/audit/**'\",\r\n     \"regressionTest\": \"server/src/db-immutability.test.ts\",\r\n-    \"fixCommit\": \"af12729225d5acc2312118d99080a1c8a72f557f\",\r\n+    \"fixCommit\": \"ba71207ae75581b11bd721c95c3a00cfa8730500\",\r\n     \"verifyEvidence\": [\r\n       \"audit/evidence/verify/F-009/01-fresh-environment.txt\",\r\n       \"audit/evidence/verify/F-009/02-original-repro.txt\",\r\n@@ -595,7 +609,7 @@\r\n     ],\r\n     \"effort\": \"S\",\r\n     \"owner\": \"agent\",\r\n-    \"status\": \"OPEN\",\r\n+    \"status\": \"FIXED-UNVERIFIED\",\r\n     \"statusHistory\": [\r\n       {\r\n         \"status\": \"OPEN\",\r\n@@ -603,11 +617,25 @@\r\n         \"commit\": null,\r\n         \"evidenceLink\": \"audit/findings/F-011.md\",\r\n         \"note\": \"Discovered during audit phase.\"\r\n+      },\r\n+      {\r\n+        \"status\": \"IN-PROGRESS\",\r\n+        \"date\": \"2026-11-22\",\r\n+        \"commit\": null,\r\n+        \"evidenceLink\": \"audit/evidence/before-F-011.txt\",\r\n+        \"note\": \"Fixing financial year calculation timezone issue.\"\r\n+      },\r\n+      {\r\n+        \"status\": \"FIXED-UNVERIFIED\",\r\n+        \"date\": \"2026-11-22\",\r\n+        \"commit\": \"bfd9d049f50f28eec4c2aa27dbf88c3a9a1ff0e6\",\r\n+        \"evidenceLink\": \"audit/evidence/after-F-011.txt\",\r\n+        \"note\": \"Updated financeService.getFinancialYear() to strictly parse dates in Asia/Kolkata (IST).\"\r\n       }\r\n     ],\r\n     \"reproCommand\": \"npx vitest run --exclude '**/audit/**'\",\r\n-    \"regressionTest\": \"audit/tests/f-011-regression.spec.ts\",\r\n-    \"fixCommit\": null,\r\n+    \"regressionTest\": \"server/src/financial-year-tz.test.ts\",\r\n+    \"fixCommit\": \"bfd9d049f50f28eec4c2aa27dbf88c3a9a1ff0e6\",\r\n     \"verifyEvidence\": [],\r\n     \"siblingSweep\": {\r\n       \"done\": true,\r\ndiff --git a/audit/tracker/tracker.md b/audit/tracker/tracker.md\r\nindex 17ef604..fb62760 100644\r\n--- a/audit/tracker/tracker.md\r\n+++ b/audit/tracker/tracker.md\r\n@@ -12,9 +12,9 @@\r\n ### By Status\r\n | Status | Count | Percentage |\r\n |---|---|---|\r\n-| OPEN | 100 | 94.3% |\r\n+| OPEN | 99 | 93.4% |\r\n | IN-PROGRESS | 0 | 0.0% |\r\n-| FIXED-UNVERIFIED | 0 | 0.0% |\r\n+| FIXED-UNVERIFIED | 2 | 1.9% |\r\n | VERIFIED | 1 | 0.9% |\r\n | BLOCKED | 0 | 0.0% |\r\n | WONT-FIX | 4 | 3.8% |\r\n@@ -43,13 +43,13 @@\r\n | ID | Tier | Sev | Cluster | Status | Approval | Depends On | Title |\r\n |---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n | **F-097** | T1 | P2 | CLUSTER-01 | `VERIFIED` | schema | - | Architectural Inconsistency: Zero Centralized Currency \u0026 Date Formatters across 7 Financial Surfaces (Ad-hoc `.toFixed(2)` \u0026 Fragmented Locales) |\r\n-| **F-009** | T1 | P1 | CLUSTER-03 | `REJECTED` | schema | - | Application database role retains full UPDATE and DELETE privileges on stock movements and posted invoices without database triggers or rules |\r\n+| **F-009** | T1 | P1 | CLUSTER-03 | `FIXED-UNVERIFIED` | schema | - | Application database role retains full UPDATE and DELETE privileges on stock movements and posted invoices without database triggers or rules |\r\n | **F-010** | T1 | P1 | CLUSTER-01 | `OPEN` | schema | F-009 | Invoice tax and totals calculated with unrounded JS float math produce 1-2 paise rounding drift in 46.4% of invoices |\r\n | **F-036** | T1 | P0 | CLUSTER-01 | `OPEN` | schema | F-010 | Dashboard Sales Revenue Silently Drops Invoices Without Lines (SQL vs API Mismatch) |\r\n | **F-007** | T1 | P0 | CLUSTER-02 | `OPEN` | none | F-009 | Missing row-level lock in sales order approval allows concurrent orders to exceed ATP stock by over 100% |\r\n | **F-008** | T1 | P0 | CLUSTER-02 | `OPEN` | none | F-009 | Non-atomic `count()` based dispatch sequence generation causes unique constraint crashes on concurrent dispatches |\r\n | **F-015** | T1 | P2 | CLUSTER-02 | `OPEN` | none | F-009, F-008 | Idempotency pre-query race condition causes concurrent duplicate submissions to crash with unhandled 500 unique constraint error |\r\n-| **F-011** | T1 | P1 | CLUSTER-03 | `OPEN` | schema | - | `financeService.getFinancialYear()` relies on Node process timezone, misclassifying April 1st morning invoices into previous financial year on UTC servers |\r\n+| **F-011** | T1 | P1 | CLUSTER-03 | `FIXED-UNVERIFIED` | schema | - | `financeService.getFinancialYear()` relies on Node process timezone, misclassifying April 1st morning invoices into previous financial year on UTC servers |\r\n | **F-013** | T1 | P1 | CLUSTER-03 | `OPEN` | schema | - | Backend lacks payment bounce/reversal methods and debit note data structures required for double-entry correction |\r\n | **F-014** | T1 | P2 | CLUSTER-03 | `OPEN` | schema | - | Statutory GST rates are read from static `product.taxRate` columns; the dedicated `TaxRate` master table is never queried |\r\n | **F-016** | T1 | P2 | CLUSTER-03 | `OPEN` | schema | - | Packaging capacity mismatch warning is hardcoded to specific SKU and multiplier, and is never persisted to database |\r\n"}}}
